% -------------------- 2. DOMAIN-DRIVEN DESIGN --------------------
\chapter{Domain-Driven Design}

The backend has been organized around practical bounded contexts aligned with railway operations. While implemented as a modular monolith, the service boundaries are explicit enough to support future migration toward service decomposition. Each context owns its routes, controllers, and persistence logic, while context interactions are mediated through train number scoping, shared identities, and role-based middleware.

