\midrule
Identity \& Access & Complaint Operations & Customer/Supplier & Complaint creation and querying rely on authenticated user identity and train scope from auth middleware. \\
Identity \& Access & Catering \& Orders & Customer/Supplier & Order lifecycle operations consume user identity and train number claims from JWT middleware. \\
Identity \& Access & Emergency Response & Customer/Supplier & Emergency ownership and resolve permissions are enforced using authenticated user identity. \\
Identity \& Access & Lost \& Found Management & Customer/Supplier & Item creation and mutation are tied to authenticated ownership checks. \\
Complaint Operations & Governance \& Analytics & Conformist & Aggregated complaint data powers admin and superadmin statistical endpoints. \\
Catering \& Orders & Governance \& Analytics & Conformist & Order statuses and totals are consumed by train-level and system-level analytics. \\
Emergency Response & Governance \& Analytics & Conformist & Emergency volume and status metrics feed superadmin dashboards. \\
Governance \& Analytics & Staff Operations & Publisher/Subscriber (Operational) & Admin commands are produced by admin context and consumed/read by staff context. \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabularx}
\end{table}

