% -------------------- 3. TECHNOLOGY STACK SUMMARY --------------------
\chapter{Technology Stack Summary}

The technology stack is selected for rapid API development, modular maintainability, and strong operational observability. The runtime is Node.js with Express, MongoDB is used as the primary store, and JWT-based auth with secure cookies enables role-aware session management. Swagger enhances interface transparency, while Jest/Supertest provide deterministic regression protection.

\section{Complete Technology Map}

\begin{longtable}{>{\bfseries}p{0.15\textwidth} p{0.22\textwidth} p{0.16\textwidth} p{0.39\textwidth}}
\toprule
\rowcolor{TableHeader}
\textcolor{TableHeaderText}{Layer} & \textcolor{TableHeaderText}{Technology} & \textcolor{TableHeaderText}{Version (pkg)} & \textcolor{TableHeaderText}{Purpose} \\
\midrule
\endfirsthead
\toprule
\rowcolor{TableHeader}
\textcolor{TableHeaderText}{Layer} & \textcolor{TableHeaderText}{Technology} & \textcolor{TableHeaderText}{Version (pkg)} & \textcolor{TableHeaderText}{Purpose} \\
\midrule
\endhead
Backend Runtime & Node.js + Express & express 5.1.0 & HTTP API framework and middleware pipeline. \\
Data Layer & MongoDB + Mongoose & mongoose 8.19.0 & Schema-based persistence and indexing. \\
Auth \& Security & jsonwebtoken, bcryptjs, cookie-parser, cors & jwt 9.0.2, bcryptjs 3.0.2 & Token issuance, password hashing, cookie parsing, cross-origin control. \\
Validation & zod & zod 4.1.11 & Request body validation and typed constraints. \\
File Upload & multer, streamifier, cloudinary & multer 2.0.2, cloudinary 2.7.0 & Multipart ingestion and streaming media upload. \\
Observability & morgan, rotating-file-stream, custom logger & morgan 1.10.1 & Access and error log capture for operational diagnosis. \\
API Documentation & swagger-jsdoc, swagger-ui-express & 6.2.8 / 5.0.1 & Machine-readable and interactive API docs. \\
Testing & jest, supertest & 30.2.0 / 7.1.4 & Unit and API-contract testing in isolated mode. \\
Environment & dotenv & 17.2.3 & Environment-driven configuration. \\
\bottomrule
\end{longtable}

