\section{Edge-Case Coverage Matrix}

\begin{longtable}{>{\bfseries}p{0.2\textwidth} p{0.2\textwidth} p{0.22\textwidth} p{0.3\textwidth}}
\toprule
\rowcolor{TableHeader}
\textcolor{TableHeaderText}{Category} & \textcolor{TableHeaderText}{Representative Endpoint} & \textcolor{TableHeaderText}{Expected Outcome} & \textcolor{TableHeaderText}{Validation Intent} \\
\midrule
\endfirsthead
\toprule
\rowcolor{TableHeader}
\textcolor{TableHeaderText}{Category} & \textcolor{TableHeaderText}{Representative Endpoint} & \textcolor{TableHeaderText}{Expected Outcome} & \textcolor{TableHeaderText}{Validation Intent} \\
\midrule
\endhead
Auth Missing Token & \texttt{GET /user/profile} & 401 & Prevent unauthorized profile access. \\
Auth Malformed Token & \texttt{GET /admin/train-staff} & 401 & Reject malformed token payloads. \\
Auth Expired Token & \texttt{GET /staff/profile} & 401 & Enforce token expiry boundary. \\
Role Violation & \texttt{GET /staff/profile} (forbidden role) & 403 & Prevent cross-role endpoint misuse. \\
Validation Failure & \texttt{POST /user/register} (empty payload) & 400 & Enforce request contract quality. \\
Domain Validation & \texttt{POST /catering/order} (invalid items type) & 400 & Guard schema/semantic correctness. \\
Boundary Validation & \texttt{POST /feedback} (rating out of range) & 400 & Enforce rating boundaries. \\
Resource Absence & \texttt{GET /food/non-existent-id} & 404 & Proper not-found semantics. \\
Unhandled Exception & \texttt{GET /news} (forced throw in test) & 500 & Verify defensive server behavior. \\
Workflow Integrity & Complaint satisfaction rollback flow & Pending after negative confirmation & Guarantee reversible complaint closure pipeline. \\
\bottomrule
\end{longtable}

